{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-01555-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["이날 검찰인사위 심의만 거친다면 중간 간부급에 대한 대규모 인사도 법적으로 무리 없어지게 되는 셈","필수 보직 기간은 1년"],"reason":"The summary keeps the meeting date and the agenda of the three dispatched prosecutors. The third sentence is garbled: it says the 'principle on the mandatory tenure' would make a large reshuffle legally fine, which blurs the relation. It also omits the 1-year tenure and the exception rule, and so the claim loses its condition. The sentence reads awkwardly."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["주요 교체 대상으로 거론되는 인물은 ... 송경호","필수 보직 기간 관련 원칙이 논의 대상이 될 것이란 얘기"],"reason":"The summary accurately covers the date, the agenda, the speculation about tenure principles and the named replacement targets. It leaves out the legal exception route and the 'Yoon Suk-yeol division' context. The last sentence is incomplete and awkward, and it does not say these are investigation-team members."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["수사팀 교체의 가늠자가 될 것이란 해석","예외 규정이다","검찰인사위 심의를 거쳐 그 기한을 달리할 수 있다"],"reason":"The summary is accurate and fluent. It gives the 1-year tenure rule but leaves out the exception through committee review. That exception is the key point that makes a large reshuffle legally possible, so omitting it changes what the reader understands."},"D":{"adequacy":4,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["필수 보직 기간은 1년","검찰인사위 심의만 거친다면 ... 법적으로 무리 없어지게 되는 셈"],"reason":"The summary covers the meeting, the interpretation that it will gauge a replacement of the investigation teams, the 1-year tenure and the committee-review exception. It leaves out the named targets and the agenda detail, and it does not mark the legal point as speculation. Those are minor losses."}}}
